msgid "Move post to the Bin"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/TrashPost.php
msgid "Step 2 of moving a post to the Bin. Needs the token from prepare-trash, sent only after the user clearly said yes. Never retry after a server error or timeout: check with get-post."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UnpublishPost.php
msgid "Unpublish post"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UnpublishPost.php
msgid "Step 2 of unpublishing: moves the post back to draft. Needs the token from prepare-unpublish, sent only after the user clearly said yes. Never retry after a server error or timeout: check with get-post."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UpdateLivePost.php
msgid "Update live post"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UpdateLivePost.php
msgid "Step 2 of changing a published or scheduled post. Send exactly the same changes as prepare-update-live, with its token, only after the user clearly said yes. A revision is saved first. Never retry after a server error or timeout: check with get-post."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UpdatePost.php
msgid "Update post"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UpdatePost.php
msgid "Edits a draft or pending post. Send only what changes. Pass expected_modified_gmt from get-post so someone else's changes aren't overwritten. Published and scheduled posts must use prepare-update-live instead. Content of Elementor-built posts can only be edited in WP Admin."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UpdatePost.php
msgid "modified_gmt from get-post; the update is refused if the post has changed since."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UploadImage.php
msgid "Upload image"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UploadImage.php
msgid "Uploads a JPEG, PNG or WebP image (base64) to the Media Library. Alt text is required: ask the user for a short description. Location and camera data are removed and the image is converted to WebP. With post_id it is attached to that post; set_featured makes it the featured image, which must meet the section's size and shape rules. Images in the body must be at least 800px wide; put the returned URL in the content. For files over the size limit, or if sending fails, use get-upload-link instead."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UploadImage.php
msgid "Original file name (for reference only; the site names the file)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UploadImage.php
msgid "The image file, base64-encoded."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UploadImage.php
msgid "Alt text is required."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UploadImage.php
msgid "Ask the user for a short description of the image."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities/UploadImage.php
msgid "set_featured needs a post_id."
msgstr ""

